This fork contains substantial modifications and additions including:
multi-language support (9 languages, 18 frameworks), cloud/CMS/mobile
security checkpoints, dependency sandbox with strace-based supply chain
analysis, CycloneDX SBOM generation, CVE auditing, IDE integrations
(MCP server, LSP server, VS Code extension, JetBrains plugin), runtime
taint tracing, and compliance mapping to 6 frameworks.

Modifications are indicated by the git history of this repository.
